  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "8e1d859f",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Polder dataframe <-> add all model data behind in a dataframe \n",
    "/scistor/guest/gbb083/AeroCom/Data/POLDER_GRASP/ contains nc files of polder data\n",
    "\n",
    "XARRAY polder data monthly file consists of following var \n",
    "Data variables:\n",
    "    longitude  (data_length) float32 766kB ...\n",
    "    latitude   (data_length) float32 766kB ...\n",
    "    time       (data_length) datetime64[ns] 2MB 2010-01-01T16:57:35.999989824...\n",
    "    od440aer   (data_length) float32 766kB ...\n",
    "    abs440aer  (data_length) float32 766kB ... \n",
    "    od550aer   (data_length) float32 766kB ...\n",
    "    abs550aer  (data_length) float32 766kB ...\n",
    "    od870aer   (data_length) float32 766kB ...\n",
    "    abs870aer  (data_length) float32 766kB ...\n",
    "RENAME following parameters \n",
    "abs440aer -> AAOD  \n",
    "od440aer -> AOD440\n",
    "\n",
    "df_aod_polder <-> alpache parquet name as PARASOL_POLDER_GRASP-M-MRF_YYYTMM.parquet \n",
    "rewrite /scistor/guest/gbb083/CAMEO_scripts/interp_SPEXONE_oopp_month.py as interp_POLDER_AP3_month.py based on the input of PARASOL_POLDER_GRASP-M-MRF_YYYTMM.parquet \n",
    "\n",
    "interp_POLDER_AP3_month.py script will collocate the whole year data to\n",
    "POLDER_GRASP_coloc_{round_time}_all_YYYY.parquet\n",
    "time longitude latitude AOD_440 AAOD_440 ... AOD_440_{MODEL_NAME}  AAOD_440_{MODEL_NAME} ...\n",
    "\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 9,
   "id": "9ee70037",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
